// The derelict: a dead ship for the crew to bring back to life (the "Dead
// ship" scenario). Dark inside until its power is restored and routed;
// its vault, at the bow, is sealed by a two-key lock. Ship coordinates,
// metres: +Y up, bow toward -Z. See docs/ships.md.
Design(
    name: "DERELICT",
    hostile: false,
    model: None,
    shield: (center: (0.0, 1.5, 0.0), radii: (9.0, 5.0, 23.0)),
    turrets: [],
    modules: [(module: "derelict/hull")],
    // In a scene: its data core, behind its power puzzle and vault; or just
    // its reactor, for a side job.
    scene: Some(Site(
        encounters: [Salvage(cargo: DataCore, released_by: Some("core_clamp")), Restore(device: "reactor")],
    )),
)
